> I am currently working on an artistic project for the Belgian art centre
> Croxhapox (www.croxhapox.org) in Ghent.
> We want to translate a short text in as many languages as possible -
> living, dead, artificial, any language...
> The final result will be a network of connection between people and
> organisations and our art centre, which will be documented online and in a
> publication.
